## Civic template (design/templates/slide/civic, document/civic, sheet/civic)

The "Civic" template's design values (color steps, type scale, border widths,
corner radius, spacing) are copied and adapted from the CSS of the Digital
Agency of Japan's Design System example components:
https://github.com/digital-go-jp/design-system-example-components-html

This project is not produced or endorsed by the Digital Agency of Japan. The
values were adapted to fit this project's slide/document/question-sheet
layouts (choice of type scale, the slide's 12-column grid and page types,
and colors adjusted to meet this project's contrast checks).

